# Baseball Bat: "tap up to one target creature" - up to one, so the attack trigger may choose none (CR 601.2c, 115.1): the
# Ornithopter stays untapped and the equipped Savannah Lions (3/2 with the Bat) is still an attacker.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Savannah Lions
Baseball Bat
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Savannah Lions.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Baseball Bat.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Savannah Lions > Bot2)
Bot1.Target()
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Baseball Bat.AttachedTo = Savannah Lions
